# Dev Container only

This project is developed in `.devcontainer/`. The host needs Docker and VS Code or Cursor. Node, npm, and editor extensions are not host dependencies.

- Put editor settings and extensions in `.devcontainer/devcontainer.json` (`customizations.vscode`). Do not add `.vscode/settings.json` or `.vscode/extensions.json`.
- Do not document or assume a local Node install.
- npm scripts run inside the container.
- If you need a development dependency add it to .devcontainer/Dockerfile
